firmware, or artwork.

== Recovered schema provenance ==

The protobuf schema in crates/cortex-rs/proto/ was recovered from the Neural
DSP Cortex Control desktop application by the stokes-audio/pyquadcortex
project. It is vendored here under the MIT license's distribution terms, with
attribution. The schema is limited to what interoperability requires.